			<div class="content" id="post-content-4408159">
									

<p>So, yeah. 100 tales in just under eight years. Hard to believe. I'm fairly sure I'm the first person to hit this milestone, but I'm not 100% on that.</p>
<p>The wiki's become kind of a home for me. Somewhere where I can express myself, experiment with my writing, and find people with like-minded interests to hang out with and snark about stuff.</p>
<p>A lot of people have helped me over the years.</p>
